{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MCjUA5uohzy12N7mwrrhPT","type":"tool_result","content":"total 10080\ndrwxr-xr-x@ 9 user  wheel      288 Nov  4 20:08 .\ndrwxr-xr-x@ 5 user  wheel      160 Nov  4 20:08 ..\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 user  wheel     3474 Nov  4 20:08 TASK.md\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 user  wheel    49008 Nov  4 20:08 editor.log\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 user  wheel      448 Nov  4 20:08 embed.py\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 user  wheel     1829 Nov  4 20:08 evidence.csv\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 user  wheel   655616 Nov  4 20:08 evidence_M.npz\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 user  wheel      929 Nov  4 20:08 scorer.py\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 user  wheel  4435702 Nov  4 20:08 scorer_in.npz\n\"\"\"Laya scorer helper. M: [n, 5, 1024] marker vectors (one per department option).\"\"\"\nimport numpy as np, torch\nDEPTS = [\"cards\", \"disputes\", \"transfers_topups\", \"fees_fx\", \"account_security\"]\ndef load(path):\n    d = np.load(path); return {k: d[k] for k in d.files}\ndef save(S, path):\n    np.savez(path, **S)\ndef gelu(x):\n    return 0.5 * x * (1 + torch.erf(torch.from_numpy(np.ascontiguousarray(x)) / np.sqrt(2)).numpy())\ndef logits(S, M):\n    mu = M.mean(-1, keepdims=True); var = M.var(-1, keepdims=True)\n    h = (M - mu) / np.sqrt(var + 1e-5) * S[\"ln_w\"] + S[\"ln_b\"]\n    z = (gelu(h @ S[\"W1\"] + S[\"b1\"]) @ S[\"W2\"] + S[\"b2\"])[..., 0]\n    i, e = 0, M\n    while f\"extra_W{i}\" in S:\n        e = e @ S[f\"extra_W{i}\"] + S[f\"extra_b{i}\"]\n        if f\"extra_W{i + 1}\" in S:\n            e = np.maximum(e, 0)\n        i += 1\n    return z + e[..., 0] if i else z\ndef predict(S, M):\n    return [DEPTS[i] for i in logits(S, M).argmax(-1)]\n\"\"\"Run frozen Laya on your own messages: python embed.py out.npz \"message 1\" \"message 2\" ...\nWrites M [n, 5, 1024]: the scorer input for each department option. Takes ~10 s to load.\"\"\"\nimport sys\nsys.path.insert(0, '<lab>/laya')\nimport numpy as np, laya_lab as L\na = L.load_agent()\nnp.savez(sys.argv[1], M=L.marker_vectors(a, sys.argv[2:]))\nprint(\"wrote\", sys.argv[1], len(sys.argv) - 2, \"messages\")\ntext\tcorrect\nWhat are the age requirements for service?\taccount_security\nCan you tell me what countries you offer support for?\taccount_security\nCan I get a card even though I live in the US\taccount_security\nIs it possible to get a card outside the UK?\taccount_security\nHow old do my kids need to be to use your service?\taccount_security\nwhere do you have locations at\taccount_security\nCan I open an account for my children?\taccount_security\nDo you have an age limit?\taccount_security\nDo you have to be 18 to make an account?\taccount_security\nCan I use this all over the world?\taccount_security\nWhich countries do you support?\taccount_security\nI don't live in the UK. Can I still get a card?\taccount_security\nWhich countries do you work with?\taccount_security\nHow old do you need to be to open an account?\taccount_security\nDo you have any accounts for children ?\taccount_security\nDo you support all countries?\taccount_security\nI would like to have a physical card to carry around and use. How can I get one?\tcards\nI have to make more then a few disposable cards per day.\tcards\nHow do I activate a card?\tcards\nI dont have identification\taccount_security\nWhat forms of ID do you need for identity verification?\taccount_security\ni am express delivering my card to the us, how long will that take\tcards\nWhere do I get a virtual card?\tcards\nI would like to track the card you sent to me.\tcards\nWhat is the identity check for?\taccount_security\nIs there a way to order a virtual card on the website?\tcards\nI have some transactions on my account I did not make. Can you cancel my card and prevent further use.\tcards\nHow do I modify my account details?\taccount_security\nWhich merchants accept my card?\tcards\nI can't access my account.\taccount_security\nHow to a go about ordering a disposable virtual card?\tcards\nI need my card soon.\tcards\nln_w (1024,)\nln_b (1024,)